# ==============================================================================
# Tytul:        oggcore.rsp.tmpl
# Opis:         Plik odpowiedzi instalatora GoldenGate 26ai (23.26) Microservices dla Oracle:
#               oprogramowanie lokalnie w OGG_HOME na kazdym wezle RAC i na ggtgt (MAA: binaria
#               nie na ACFS). INSTALL_OPTION sprawdzany ze wzorcem z paczki (ostrzezenie przy roznicy).
# Description [EN]: GoldenGate 26ai (23.26) Microservices installer response file for Oracle:
#               software local in OGG_HOME on each RAC node and on ggtgt (MAA: binaries not on
#               ACFS). INSTALL_OPTION is compared with the sample shipped in the ZIP (warning).
#
# Autor:        KCB Kris
# Data:         2026-11-14
# Wersja:       1.0
# Konwencje:    <repo>/SETTINGS.md
#
# Wymagania [PL]:    - GoldenGate 23.26.4 for Oracle, Linux x86-64; wzorzec .../Disk1/response/oggcore.rsp
# Requirements [EN]: - GoldenGate 23.26.4 for Oracle, Linux x86-64; sample .../Disk1/response/oggcore.rsp
#
# Uzycie [PL]:       automatycznie: lab.cmd ogg (80_install_ogg.sh)
# Usage [EN]:        automatic: lab.cmd ogg (80_install_ogg.sh)
# ==============================================================================
oracle.install.responseFileVersion=/oracle/install/rspfmt_ogginstall_response_schema_v23_1_0
INSTALL_OPTION=ORA23ai
SOFTWARE_LOCATION={{OGG_HOME}}
INVENTORY_LOCATION={{INVENTORY}}
UNIX_GROUP_NAME=oinstall
